silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g1_sourcepacket a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g1_sourcepacket" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g1_sourcepacket silm:hasLongDescription "The G1:SourcePacket is the Mittens body-mass observation record from the May 2026 vet visit at Tartu Animal Clinic, entering the engine as a typed quality-claim source packet. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{G1:SourcePacket} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
