    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g2_typedclaim" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g2_typedclaim silm:hasLongDescription "The G2:TypedClaim is the Mittens vaccination record FVRCP-2026-03-15, entering as a typed evidence packet with provenance and validation envelope. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G2:TypedClaim} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
