silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g5_shapegate silm:hasLongDescription "The G5:ShapeGate is the Mittens microchip-id witness 985112000123456 entering as a typed identifier source leg into the Music engine cocone. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G5:ShapeGate}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
