    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g7_avrorecord" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g7_avrorecord silm:hasLongDescription "The G7:AvroRecord is the Mittens coat-pattern observation (torbie, three-color) entering as a typed quality-claim into the manifest profile reader. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G7:AvroRecord} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
