silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#_ silm:hasLongDescription "The \\ is the Mittens domestic-cat classification leg (DomesticCat) as a typed source-leg arrow that anchors BY Mittens, not as an identity. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g3_taskgraph a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g3_taskgraph" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g3_taskgraph silm:hasLongDescription "The G3:TaskGraph is the Felis catus / TSN 183798 taxonomy source leg, recoverable as a typed leg into D_Mittens but not interchangeable with the colimit apex Mittens. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G3:TaskGraph}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g4_manifest a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g4_manifest" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g4_manifest silm:hasLongDescription "The G4:Manifest is the ShapeGate that validates the body-mass measurement schema (kg, range 2-12) before admission to the task node. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G4:Manifest} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g6_trace a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g6_trace" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g6_trace silm:hasLongDescription "The G6:Trace is the TaskNode that records the admitted body-mass measurement as the engine's executable transformation. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G6:Trace} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g11_kgnode a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "urn:silmaril:entity#instances.papers.02_music.sections.02_twelve_gaps.concrete_anchor#g11_kgnode" .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g11_kgnode silm:hasLongDescription "The G11:KGNode is the TraceWitness emitted from the body-mass measurement task, the outgoing-profile representative of the typed work. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{G11:KGNode}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g9_catuscollision a owl:NamedIndividual ;
