silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#g9_catuscollision silm:hasLongDescription "The G9:CatusCollision is the ChunkManifest profiling the music-entry task — a Yoneda-profile reader for incoming and outgoing arrows of the engine apex. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '] \\concept{G9:CatusCollision} \\', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
