silm:instances_papers_02_music_sections_02_twelve_gaps_concrete_anchor#feliscatus silm:hasLongDescription "The FelisCatus is the AvroPacket serializing a Mittens body-mass observation as a typed record schema, licensed by the AvroSchema for transport. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol '\\concept{FelisCatus}/\\text{\\Acr{TSN}}', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
